- [BorrowerIntakeOSB](file:///c:/ramu/Project_Assignment/RapidX/FreddeMac_Project_RapidX/Work/LendWise-Mortgage-System/lendwise-orchestration/osb-services/BorrowerIntakeOSB) -> Binds to `BorrowerIntakeComposite`
- [DocumentProcessingOSB](file:///c:/ramu/Project_Assignment/RapidX/FreddeMac_Project_RapidX/Work/LendWise-Mortgage-System/lendwise-orchestration/osb-services/DocumentProcessingOSB) -> Binds to `DocumentProcessingComposite`
- [UnderwritingOSB](file:///c:/ramu/Project_Assignment/RapidX/FreddeMac_Project_RapidX/Work/LendWise-Mortgage-System/lendwise-orchestration/osb-services/UnderwritingOSB) -> Binds to `UnderwritingComposite`
- [ComplianceOSB](file:///c:/ramu/Project_Assignment/RapidX/FreddeMac_Project_RapidX/Work/LendWise-Mortgage-System/lendwise-orchestration/osb-services/ComplianceOSB) -> Binds to `ComplianceComposite`
- [PricingEngineOSB](file:///c:/ramu/Project_Assignment/RapidX/FreddeMac_Project_RapidX/Work/LendWise-Mortgage-System/lendwise-orchestration/osb-services/PricingEngineOSB) -> Binds to `PricingEngineComposite`
- [ClosingDisclosureOSB](file:///c:/ramu/Project_Assignment/RapidX/FreddeMac_Project_RapidX/Work/LendWise-Mortgage-System/lendwise-orchestration/osb-services/ClosingDisclosureOSB) -> Binds to `ClosingDisclosureComposite`

