- Added common schema [CommonFault.xsd](file:///c:/ramu/Project_Assignment/RapidX/FreddeMac_Project_RapidX/Work/LendWise-Mortgage-System/lendwise-orchestration/osb-services/common/schemas/CommonFault.xsd) and pipeline [FaultHandler.pipeline](file:///c:/ramu/Project_Assignment/RapidX/FreddeMac_Project_RapidX/Work/LendWise-Mortgage-System/lendwise-orchestration/osb-services/common/faults/FaultHandler.pipeline).
